#. よし、次はここだ…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So, this is our next location."
msgstr ""

#. え？　このホールも事件に関係してるの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? This place is related to the investigation?"
msgstr ""

#. …自分で考えろ。
#. それでなければ面白くないだろう？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Figure it out for yourself. It's no fun if you don't,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …調べる場所くらいは、自分で考えろ。
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You could at least try and figure out where we should\n"
"check without my help."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. なんかを気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. Now's\n"
"no time to think about it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は、この監視カメラで見ていたはずだ。
#. 不二咲さんが殺されたところも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even as Chihiro was being murdered, I bet the\n"
"mastermind was just sitting there watching...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はそれを知った上で…
#. ボクらにこんな事をさせているのか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They know what's happened, and they're still forcing\n"
"us to go through with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そっちは現場ですらないぞ…
#. 間抜けが。
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's not even the scene of the crime. Idiot."
msgstr ""

#. もう現場は調べたはずだ。
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You've already spent plenty of time checking the crime\n"
"scene."
msgstr ""

#. それに、まだここで調べるべき事が
#. 残っているぞ。
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There are plenty of other things left to check here."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、この<CLT 3>カードリーダー<CLT>って、
#. 電子生徒手帳に対応しているんだよね？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If I remember right, this <CLT 3>card reader<CLT> is meant to\n"
"work with our handbooks, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 何か気になる事でもあるのか？
#. なら、モノクマに直接聞いてみるがいい。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Do you have an issue with it? If so, you should take\n"
"it up with Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と言い終わるや否や、
#. 十神クンは、パンパンと手を鳴らし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He said that, then quickly and sharply clapped his\n"
"hands together.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お呼びですかッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You called for me!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>飼い慣らされてる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Has he been domesticated...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木から、お前に質問があるらしいぞ…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It seems that Makoto has a question for you."
msgstr ""

#. はい、なぁにー？
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Sure, what's up?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…ここのカードリーダーについて、
#. 聞きたいんだ…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm...well, it's just about this card reader."
msgstr ""

#. そのカードリーダーは、オマエラにお配りしている
#. 電子生徒手帳に対応しています！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Yes, the card readers have all been designed to\n"
"interface with each of your e-Handbooks!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>電子生徒手帳の性別<CLT>に応じた更衣室にしか、
#. 入れないようになっているから、注意してね！
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You can only enter the locker room corresponding to\n"
"the <CLT 3>gender listed in your individual handbook<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ロック解除している隙に、
#. <CLT 3>２人同時で入るのも不可能<CLT>なんだったな？
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And it's <CLT 3>impossible for two people in a row to go\n"
"through<CLT> while the door is unlocked, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなエロティックテロリストがいたら…
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If there were some sort of erotic terrorist on the\n"
"prowl..."
msgstr ""

#. 天井のガトリングガンで、
#. ハチの巣地獄ですわいッ！！
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"The ceiling-mounted Gatling gun would initiate a Swiss\n"
"cheese slaughter!"
msgstr ""

#. それと…電子生徒手帳を<CLT 3>他人に貸す<CLT>のも、
#. <CLT 3>校則で禁止<CLT>されたんだったな。
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And the <CLT 3>school regulations<CLT> prohibit anyone from\n"
"<CLT 3>lending someone else<CLT> their handbook, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. イエスザッツライト！
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Correctly correct!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女子なら女子更衣室に…
#. 男子なら男子更衣室にしか入れないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That means only girls can go in the girls locker room,\n"
"and only boys can go in the boys locker room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、不二咲さんの死体が、
#. 女子更衣室で見つかったって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words, Chihiro's body being found in the\n"
"girls locker room means...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい苗木…透けて見えるぞ。
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey, Makoto. I can see right through you."
msgstr ""

#. 透けて…？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "See right...through me?"
msgstr ""

#. …お前はこう考えているんだろう？
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Allow me to tell you what you're thinking..."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲千尋の死体が女子更衣室で見つかった以上、
#. 犯人は女子更衣室に入ったはず…
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Since Chihiro was found in the girls locker room, the\n"
"killer must have been able to get in there."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、犯人は女子の誰かなんじゃないかと…
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As such, the killer must be one of the girls. Did I\n"
"get it right?"
msgstr ""

#. まったく…甘いな…
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Good lord you're simple."
msgstr ""

#. …違うの？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. もう一度、よく校則を確認してみるんだな。
#. 追加されたルールには、こうあったはずだ。
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You should pay closer attention to the regulations.\n"
"The answer has been in front of you the entire time."
msgstr ""

#. 『電子生徒手帳の他人への貸与禁止』とな…
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"\"Loaning your e-Handbook to another student is\n"
"strictly prohibited.\""
msgstr ""

#. 禁止されてるのは、他人に貸す行為だけだ。
#. <CLT 3>借りる事は禁止されていない<CLT>。
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Only the act of *loaning* a handbook is prohibited.\n"
"<CLT 3>Borrowing someone else's is perfectly fine<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. にょほほほッ！　さっすが十神財閥の御曹司様ッ！！
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Nyohohoho! I would expect nothing less from the\n"
"prodigal son of the noble Togami family!"
msgstr ""

#. 気付いちゃいましたね、この校則の<CLT 3>“抜け道”<CLT>に！！
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So you managed to sniff out the <CLT 3>loophole<CLT> in the\n"
"regulations!"
msgstr ""

#. お前の事だ、あえて抜け道を用意したんだろう？
#. 謎解きが少しでも面白くなるようにと…
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Knowing you, I would bet you created it on purpose,\n"
"didn't you? To add a little more excitement to things."
msgstr ""

#. キャー！　この程度は朝飯前のお通し扱い！？
#. サッスガですねぇ！
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kyaaah! You're treating me like a puny little\n"
"appetizer instead of the main course that I am!"
msgstr ""

#. さらに言えば、死人に口なしとあるように、
#. 死人とは人でなく物なのですよ、もはや…！
msgctxt "0045 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now then, since the dead can't actually talk, they're\n"
"not people anymore—they're things!"
msgstr ""

#. …アンダスタン？
msgctxt "0046 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Get it? Got it? Good."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと待ってよ、抜け道って言うけどさ…
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, hold on... You're saying that's a loophole,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. 他人から借りるって事は…つまり誰かが貸すって事で…
#. そうなると…えーっと……
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In order to borrow something from someone, then...that\n"
"means someone would have to loan it, so...uhh..."
msgstr ""

#. 眠い…
msgctxt "0049 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So sleepy..."
msgstr ""

#. 眠たいヤツだよ、キミは！
#. 十神クンを見習って、もっとシャキッとしなさいッ！！
msgctxt "0050 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Just listening to you makes me wanna pass out! Be more\n"
"like Byakuya and get your poop together!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなキミは、放置プレイの刑に処す！
msgctxt "0051 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Or else I'll charge you with criminal negligence!"
msgstr ""

#. もう質問は受け付けないよ！　
#. 自分で考えなさいッ！！
msgctxt "0052 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"No more questions! Figure out the rest your own damn\n"
"self!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …仕方がない。出来の悪い相棒の為に、
#. モノクマに代わって俺が教えてやろう。
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, I know you are unfortunately lacking in mental\n"
"faculties, so I'll fill you in myself."
msgstr ""

#. 行くぞ、<CLT 3>玄関ホール<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0055 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Let's head to the <CLT 3>main hall<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …玄関ホール？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The main hall...?"
msgstr ""

#. そこに行けばわかる。
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That'll help you understand what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>カードリーダー<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
