msgid "The main hall...?"
msgstr ""

#. そこに行けばわかる。
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That'll help you understand what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>カードリーダー<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Card Reader<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんはこの銃で…
#. …な訳ないよな。これが凶器ならハチの巣だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe this gun was used to... No, impossible. If that\n"
"were true, Chihiro would be riddled with holes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この棚には…水泳用の色々な用具が並んでいる…
#. 不二咲さんの事件とは関係なさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are a bunch of different pool-related items on\n"
"the shelf. Which have nothing to do with the case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>浮き輪がある…
#. 不二咲さんの事件とは明らかに関係なさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A flotation donut... I don't think it's related to\n"
"what happened to Chihiro.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待て…まだ調べるべき事があるだろう。
msgctxt "0108 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hold on. We still have more to check here."
msgstr ""
